  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The next morning, Xingzi dresses up in sparkling pink expecting to welcome Chun Yuqiao back to the chief editor's office, only for an unexpected newcomer's assistant to arrive first. Listen to their Mandarin surprise first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看我这粉衣服，用来迎接淳于总怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "够女人，非常小女人！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看，一闪一闪粉晶晶的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "兄弟们都准备好了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "兄弟们都好着呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "对，这里是星天总编室，您有何贵干？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你哪位啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不是，这几个意思啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "她说她是我的助理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "谢灵？怎么会是他？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "二位看起来很惊讶啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这到底是怎么一回事？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看我这粉衣服，用来迎接淳于总怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look at my pink outfit—how is it for welcoming Mr Chun Yuqiao back?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "够女人，非常小女人！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Plenty feminine, super sweet and ladylike!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看，一闪一闪粉晶晶的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look how it sparkles in glittery pink.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "兄弟们都准备好了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are all the guys on the crew ready?'",
      "gap": 0.45
