      "t": "对，这里是星天总编室，您有何贵干？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, this is Xingtian's chief editor office; what can I do for you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你哪位啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who might you be?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不是，这几个意思啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait a second, what is that supposed to mean?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "她说她是我的助理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She said that she is my assistant.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "谢灵？怎么会是他？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xie Ling? How on earth could it be him?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "二位看起来很惊讶啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The two of you look awfully surprised.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这到底是怎么一回事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What on earth is going on here?'",
      "gap": 0.65
